\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs32\insrsid1342299\charrsid12457087 Interior \endash  Amurescan King\rquote s Court, Midday
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 The Amurescan King, a large Mastiff with dark brown/tan
 fur, sits alongside several of his Advisors and fellow Lords.  The Lords are a scattering of different dog breeds, all well-dressed.  Guards in the chamber consist of other canines, and one red fox hovering near 
the King throughout the proceedings, an Aid or possible Intelligence Officer, it is unclear.  The fox is well-dressed, but understated.  One of the Lords in the Court, not focu
sed on or of any clear importance at first, is an older GSD with an eyepatch, who appears to be asleep or not paying partic
ular attention.  He is framed somewhere in the lower seating area.  Another group of Lords sits in the upper deck, mostly spectators to the goings-on, and will serve as exposition for narrative facts not already known.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid14169615 Pages 1-2 (2 Page Spread)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 
\par \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Delilah Denholme (English Springer Spaniel, female) and Laurel Cuthbert (Irish Wolfhound mix, female) stand before the Patriarchal ruling body
 of their country.  They are dressed well, but modestly, and Laurel carries with her a wax-sealed paper with the stamp of t
he Monarchy on it.  The women stand alone in the middle of a vast, empty floor, surrounded on all sides by the Lords, facing the King.  They are starkly lit by large, bright windows.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 
