\par Fox \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \'93Lady Delilah Denholme, daughter of the late Crown Admiral Lucius Denholme.\'94 (next panel focuses on her) \'93Wife of Luther Denholme, Crown Admiral of the Cerberus Fleet.
\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid11421979 Canine #1 in Balcony \endash }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299  \'93One should more appropriately say \lquote widow\rquote .\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid11421979 Canine #2 \endash }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299  \'93Is that confirmed?\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid11421979 Canine #1 \endash }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299  \'93I am supposing that\rquote s why she\rquote s
 here.  They lost the Colony, you know.  Word is the fleet\rquote s held up or sunk somewhere in Mataa.\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Canine #2 \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 (yawns) \'93Tragic.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid11041399 
