\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid10451994 Fox \endash }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299  \'93
Lady Laurel Cuthbert, daughter of Honored Templar and Steward of the Cerberus Fleet, Johannes Cuthbert.\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid10451994 Laurel \endash }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299  \'93I am honored to speak before His Majesty\rquote s Court.\'94
\par 
