\par Fox \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \'93Senior Naval Lord to the Board of Admiralty, Sir Thaddeus Rockland, have you the request before you?\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid214538 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Senior Naval Lord to the Board of Admiralty (Portuguese Water Dog) \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 
(said while looking over a stack of papers) \'93I have it on hand, yes.  This is concerning, of course, the fate of the aforementioned Cerberus Fleet, and all Lords and crew.\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Delilah \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \'93Their \lquote fate\rquote , as of twenty days ago, is known.  I\rquote 
m certain Sir Rockland is as aware of their current situation as most of the men in this chamber now are.\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Rockland \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \'93Yes, of course.  The communications passed along through merchant vessels confirm \endash 
 as of twenty days ago at least, the Cerberus Fleet is moored in the Mataa\rquote Atel A Shanivaar, the \lquote String of Tears\rquote  islands along the southern coast.  Following the loss of the Serwich Colony to savage native attacks. . .\'94
 (continues speaking in background)
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Canine #1 \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 \'93That\rquote s the third colony lost this year.  Usually you don\rquote t even hear they\rquote 
ve been overrun, they just. . . stop receiving word.  Vessels go to trade and find naught but ruins and corpses.\'94
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 Canine #2 \endash  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299 (said distastefully) \'93
