\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af2\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid9312642 Manjusha -}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid9522547  "You have no heart."
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af2\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid9312642 Rajne -}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid1342299\charrsid9522547 
 "It's a pity it wasn't an inherited condition.  Get back to running your House, and go torture yourself with guilt out of my sight."
\par 
\par Manjusha starts heading out, and catches Amon's eyes as she does.  She will in fact look tortured with guilt, and Amon's gaze is condemning.  She'll ultimately head back inside, though.
\par 
